  "notes": "{高|たか}まる means to rise, increase, or intensify. An intransitive godan verb.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- {高|たか}まる ({自動詞|じどうし}): to rise (by itself)\n- {高|たか}める ({他動詞|たどうし}): to raise (something)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {期待|きたい}が{高|たか}まる: expectations rise\n- {緊張|きんちょう}が{高|たか}まる: tension increases\n- {関心|かんしん}が{高|たか}まる: interest grows\n- {気持|きも}ちが{高|たか}まる: feelings intensify\n- {需要|じゅよう}が{高|たか}まる: demand increases\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{高|たか}まっている indicates a continuing state of heightened level or ongoing increase.",
